  "body": [
    "Video games are the biggest cultural industry in today’s interconnected world. We have a game development studio, an eSports team, content creators and we support brands and consumers to actively participate in this environment.",
    "Reply Games Studio",
    "Games for business",
    "Esports",
    "Reply Games Studio is the development studio of the Reply Group, a team of dedicated professionals who work hard to present players with exciting AA games that feature high production values, deep experiences and engaging stories on PC and next-gen consoles.",
    "The video game we created for the Italian Ministry of Foreign Affairs: an interactive and fun experience to bring the cultural heritage and wonders of Italy to a worldwide audience.",
    "To ensure fair tournaments and online gaming environments, Spike Reply proposes a cybersecurity approach to prevent cheating and fraud.",
    "Ringmaster has developed a framework for creating crypto games within the Metaverse, which guarantees the freedom to create, customize and distribute their products easily, enabling a more immersive gaming experience than ever.",
    "The Lost World is an innovative and immersive team-building experience created by Avvio Reply and Infinity Reply: a gaming adventure where teams have to work together against the clock to find clues, break codes, solve riddles and decode puzzles.",
    "The puzzle game launched by the Farnesina to narrate the beauties of Italy lands on the Internet with a dedicated page.",
    "Reply Totem is an Esports Team that focuses on the selection and growth of players, influencers and content creators from the gaming world.",
    "The surge of Esports and the increase of its fanbase are opening new exciting opportunities for marketers.",
    "Discover also"
